---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: contact.html
section: contact
title: Contact
description: How to reach Shadi Shamasneh.
---
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="tile shout fill-kw">
      <h1 id="contact-title">Say hello.</h1>
      <p>Work, a question about something I wrote, or a bug on this site. I read everything and usually reply within a couple of days.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="contact-ways">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 class="mark" id="contact-ways">Ways to reach me</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="tile way span-{% if site.email %}3{% else %}4{% endif %}">
        <p class="widget-label">GitHub</p>
        <a href="{{ site.github }}" rel="me noopener">@{{ site.githubHandle }}</a>
        <p>Best for anything about code. Open an issue or mention me.</p>
      </div>
      {%- if site.email %}
      <div class="tile way span-3">
        <p class="widget-label">Email</p>
        <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
        <p>Best for work and longer conversations.</p>
      </div>
      {%- endif %}
      <div class="tile widget span-{% if site.email %}3{% else %}2{% endif %} half">
        <p class="widget-label">My time right now</p>
        <p class="widget-value is-large num"><time data-clock>--:--</time></p>
      </div>
      <div class="tile widget span-{% if site.email %}3{% else %}2{% endif %} half fill-ok">
        <p class="widget-label">Status</p>
        <p class="widget-value"><span class="str">{{ site.status }}</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="tile span-4">
        <p class="widget-label">A good first message says</p>
        <ul class="plain-list">
          <li>what you're building, in a sentence or two</li>
          <li>where you think I can help</li>
          <li>your timeline, even a rough one</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
